<title>GREECE: Greek markets closed Monday for national holiday.</title>
<headline>Greek markets closed Monday for national holiday.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek markets were closed on Monday, Holy Ghost Day, which is a national holiday. Markets will open again on Tuesday. --Dina Kyriakidou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4 **** Users of</p>
